    "content-media-sign": "Built-in Supabase keys only; user-JWT manifest, exact matched paths,300-second URLs.",
    "chat-media-sign": "Built-in Supabase keys; compatible legacy consume bridge with original grant expiry; private-session installations refuse the legacy path.",
    "export-my-data": "Built-in URL/anon key, caller JWT reaches snapshot unchanged; no service identity or new worker.",
    "crisp-bridge": "Existing CRISP_API_URL/CRISP_API_KEY required; updated order-aware receipts. No test transfer or payout is authorized by this rollout. Preserve verify_jwt=false: the handler authenticates the caller itself before payment access. Existing direct-payment and receipt-replay requests remain compatible; legacy new listing-only payment requests return an unsent MARKET_ORDER_REQUIRED 409.",
    "daily-get-token": "HOLD production v34 after exact-source compatibility audit; do not replace with the stricter current source in this rollout.",
    "faststart-video": "Built-in URL/service-role key; authenticated webhook, verified published bindings, exact Storage version/ETag and short commit lease. Files index.ts,handler.ts,remux.ts; verify_jwt=true. No active database webhook was found in production preflight; deployment does not establish an active processing pipeline or create a new webhook."
  },
